THICKPEN - thick lines with the three join styles.

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD statement (THICKPEN)
  - the line pen: width and miter / bevel / round joins
  - stroking polylines from native code (<graphics.h>)

Try it
  THICKPEN                     REM three thick zig-zags, one per join

Build it on the machine
  grow thickpen          # -> build/THICKPEN.SED
  (grow links the berry-libc from SEEDCORE.PKT for this one automatically)
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as THICKPEN.SED, ready to use.

